{"id": "889bb1c8-73f8-4f8a-8ead-a6f964f1e635", "name": "拡散抵抗算出制約", "description": "充電プロファイルより、各温度,SOCに応じて拡散抵抗を算出する。 (充電CCV - OCV) / 充電電流 = 拡散抵抗", "inputNames": ["ccv", "ocv", "i"], "outputNames": ["r"], "parameters": {}, "code": "r = (ccv - ocv) / i", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T12:32:22.798440", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
